                        </p>
                        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-2">
                            <a href="/exam-types" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-slate-800">
